'''Purkoll''' was a [[city]] located on the [[planet]] [[Skako Minor]]<ref name="A Distant Echo" /> that served as the headquarters of the [[Techno Union]].<ref name="Old Databank">{{Databank|skako-minor|Skako Minor}} {{C|version archived on September 10, 2019; content now replaced}}</ref> [[Purkoll Tower Base|The facility]] had [[D1-series aerial battle droid]]s and [[Octuptarra tri-droid|octuptarra magna tri-droids]] guarding it. During the [[Clone Wars]], [[Advanced Recon Commando|ARC trooper]] [[Echo]] was experimented on there, and he was rescued during a [[Galactic Republic]] [[Mission to Skako Minor (Clone Wars)|mission]] to the planet led by [[Jedi General]] [[Anakin Skywalker]], [[Sergeant]] [[Hunter]], and [[Clone Captain]] [[Rex]],<ref name="A Distant Echo" /> with the facility being damaged in the process.<ref name="On the Wings of Keeradaks" />

